### Attendance & Human Desk Example Requests
@BASE_URL = http://localhost:3001
@CUSTOMER_ID = 5537999999999

### 1. Initialize Chat Session
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/chat/init
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": "{{CUSTOMER_ID}}"
}

### 2. List Available Departments and Human Agents
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/chat/agents

### 3. Customer Asks for Human Agent (Handoff Options)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": "{{CUSTOMER_ID}}",
    "text": "Quero falar com um atendente humano"
}

### 4. Transfer Customer to Department Queue (Suporte Técnico, 30s timeout)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/chat/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": "{{CUSTOMER_ID}}",
    "departmentId": "dept_suporte",
    "timeoutSeconds": 30
}

### 5. Customer Sends Message While AI is Paused
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": "{{CUSTOMER_ID}}",
    "text": "Minha luz LOS está piscando no roteador"
}

### 6. Human Agent Replies to Customer
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/chat/agent-message
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": "{{CUSTOMER_ID}}",
    "agentName": "Mariana Silva",
    "text": "Olá João! Sou a Mariana do suporte técnico. Estou analisando a potência do seu sinal de fibra óptica neste momento."
}

### 7. Resume AI Attendance Manually
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/chat/resume-ai
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": "{{CUSTOMER_ID}}"
}

### 8. Transfer Directly to Specific Online Agent (Carlos Mendes, Comercial)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/chat/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": "{{CUSTOMER_ID}}",
    "agentId": "agent_carlos",
    "timeoutSeconds": 45
}

